---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="TCPendant | Projects | Wretzelectronics">
  <article class="project-detail">
    <header class="detail-header">
      <h1 class="project-title">TCPendant</h1>
      <p class="project-tagline">Aluminum thermal pendant controlled via custom ESP32 firmware & mobile app.</p>
      <div class="tag-row">
        <span class="tag-badge">ESP32</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">Bluetooth LE</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">Custom PCB</span>
        <span class="tag-badge">React Native App</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="hero-image-wrapper">
      <img src="/images/projects/tcpendant.png" alt="TCPendant illuminated" class="detail-hero-img" />
    </div>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        TCPendant is a compact thermal pendant built around an aluminum enclosure, a custom PCB,
        and an ESP32-based control system. The project explores enclosure design, thermal control,
        embedded firmware, and mobile app development across a multi-week iterative build.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Hardware Evolution</h2>
      <p>
        The hardware evolved from early perfboard prototypes into a custom PCB and a handmade
        aluminum enclosure.
      </p>

      <div class="photo-grid">
        <div class="diagram-block">
          <h3>Scale & Form Factor</h3>
          <p class="diagram-caption">Pendant size relative to hand scale and internal glow profile.</p>
          <img src="/images/projects/tcpendant-scale.jpg" alt="TCPendant scale photo" class="diagram-img" />
        </div>

        <div class="diagram-block">
          <h3>Custom PCB (Front)</h3>
          <p class="diagram-caption">Integrated heater drivers, BLE antenna, LED controller, and power regulation.</p>
          <img src="/images/projects/tcpendant-pcb.jpg" alt="TCPendant PCB front" class="diagram-img" />
        </div>

        <div class="diagram-block">
          <h3>Perfboard Prototype</h3>
          <p class="diagram-caption">Initial circuit validation prototype built on perfboard.</p>
          <img src="/images/projects/tcpendant-perf-front.jpg" alt="TCPendant perfboard prototype" class="diagram-img" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Software & Control App</h2>
      <p>
        TCPendant includes an ESP32 firmware stack and a custom mobile application. The app provides
        temperature control, LED pattern selection, UI theme toggles, and BLE connection management.
      </p>

      <div class="diagram-block app-block">
        <h3>Mobile Application Interface</h3>
        <p class="diagram-caption">React Native dynamic control interface with BLE status monitoring.</p>
        <img src="/images/projects/tcpendant-app.jpg" alt="TCPendant mobile app screenshot" class="diagram-img app-img" />
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Challenges & Key Learnings</h2>
      <p>
        TCPendant went through multiple iterations due to hardware failures, BLE instability,
        counterfeit MOSFETs, enclosure constraints, and unexpected firmware issues. Each week
        introduced new obstacles that shaped the final design.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section cyber-card">
      <h2>Status</h2>
      <p>
        TCPendant v1 reached a functional BLE-controlled LED prototype inside a finished aluminum
        enclosure. A fully working thermal version is planned for a future rebuild.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project-detail {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .detail-header {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .project-title {
    font-size: 2.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .project-tagline {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tag-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-image-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.2);
    background: #000;
  }

  .detail-hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 480px;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .content-section h2 {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .content-section p {
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .photo-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .diagram-block {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .diagram-block h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--border-neon);
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .diagram-caption {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem !important;
  }

  .diagram-img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 6px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    background: #000;
    display: block;
  }

  .app-block {
    max-width: 400px;
  }

  .app-img {
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
</style>